{"headword":"מַלְאָךְ","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> messenger;—<span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:20\" href=\"/Exodus.23.20\">Ex 23:20</a> + 48 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאַךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:7\" href=\"/Genesis.16.7\">Gn 16:7</a> + 69 times; sfs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 23:23\" href=\"/Exodus.23.23\">Ex 23:23</a> + 3 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:7\" href=\"/Genesis.24.7\">Gn 24:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:40\" href=\"/Genesis.24.40\">40</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:4\" href=\"/Genesis.32.4\">Gn 32:4</a> + 63 times + <span dir=\"rtl\">מלאכים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 11:1\" href=\"/II_Samuel.11.1\">2 S 11:1</a> Kt (< Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">מלכים</span>); cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאֲכֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:12\" href=\"/Genesis.28.12\">Gn 28:12</a> + 11 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:12\" href=\"/Numbers.24.12\">Nu 24:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.23\">2 K 19:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכֵכֵה</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 2:14\" href=\"/Nahum.2.14\">Na 2:14</a> error for <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכֵכִי</span> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכַיְכִי</span> Ges<sup>§ 91, (2), Anm. 2</sup> or < for <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכֵךְ</span> by dittogr. from foll. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹי</span> Kö <sup>ii. 1.S 571</sup>). <span dir=\"rtl\">מַלְאָכָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 36:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.36.15\">2 Ch 36:15</a> + 8 times;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>messenger</em>,"},{"senses":[{"definition":"one sent with a message <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:4\" href=\"/Genesis.32.4\">Gn 32:4</a> + 8 times JE; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.26\">Dt 2:26</a>, (not in P); <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:35\" href=\"/Judges.6.35\">Ju 6:35</a> + 8 times; <a data-ref